{
"name": "valve_eli_lookalive_turrets",
"note": "Black Mesa East airlock's two lab turrets that only look alive (d1_eli_01): the slot in the wall 130 to 147 over the floor with its two sliding panels (func_door, taken shut), the two props_lab/LabTurret.mdl prop_dynamics with their red glow sprites, and in 'wiring' the deploy and retract relays, three sounds, the logic_case that picks the aim sound's pitch, and the six floor trigger cells (two columns of three, centres 132 across and about 100 along, each about 90 by 70) that each play one aim animation. Faces -x (the turrets look into the room); anchor on the wall plane at the slot's middle, on the floor. The cells reach 200 out from the wall: set them on the room's floor. docs/dev/prefabs.md, 'Pieces with their wiring'.",
